SUMMARY: Saturday Night with Friends! (Dinner Party\, Live Band and Dancin
 g) (Disco Band)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle\, make new friends\, dinner par
 ty and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Band!\n\n\\*Joined by my 
 other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lo
 ts of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**\\*Meet us inside S
 moke Show between 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm**\n\\*If you have to arrive after th
 at\, still let the front door guy know you are with Steve's group so he ca
 n direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive between 6:00 pm and 
 7:30 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank you!\n\n(Event Detai
 ls Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Det
 ails:\n**Saturday Night with Friends! (Dinner\, Live Disco Band and Dancin
 g)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food\, reserved seatin
 g\, Live Band and Dancing!\n-Pool Table available\n-Plenty of parking all 
 around the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Station\n\n**Event Fee:**\
 n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e transfer i
 n advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/
 )\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please)\n\n**-Arrive any time betwee
 n 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look for Steve/Organiz
 er when you arrive)**\n\\*If arriving after 8:00 you still need to let the
  guy at the front door know you are with Steve's group so he can properly 
 direct you to us and help track our numbers- Thank you for your kind co-op
 eration!\n\n(1 minute walk from the new Mt. Pleasant & Eglinton station)
